:"‘Launch starter tier’: between about 95% and 99% chance of meeting your goal, in this model. Of the links not sized yet, it depends most on how strongly ‘Support burden from starter tier’ affects ‘monthly recurring revenue’, which isn’t sized in the model yet.\n\n• This run shows some options’ chances only as a range.\n• I can't yet say how likely ‘Raise prices 10%’ is to keep monthly recurring revenue at or above £126,000 / month: I need a size for the links from Price-rise customer churn to monthly recurring revenue and from Price rise to Price-rise customer churn.\n• Roughly how much monthly recurring revenue in £/month does a change in Price-rise customer churn bring?\n\nI’ve mapped the three pricing paths and your £126,000 monthly goal.\n\n- The first pass is provisional: it uses your stated churn and subscriber ranges.\n- Keeping current pricing holds today’s values; it adds nothing in the model.\n- Starter support costs may affect profit rather than MRR, so that mechanism needs checking.\n\nI’ve read your goal, ‘monthly recurring revenue’, as the total across every tier, including ‘Starter tier MRR’. If you meant only part of it, say which.","suggested_actions":[{"id":"agent-next-strengthen","label":"Give your estimate","message":"What would most strengthen this model?"},{"id":"agent-next-pre-mortem","label":"Run a pre-mortem","message":"Run a pre-mortem with me: imagine this decision went badly. What most plausibly went wrong?"},{"id":"agent-next-what-would-change","label":"What would change this?","message":"What would most likely change this result?"}]}],"action_bar":{"v":1,"state_key":"a55ab3ce8f86ca6e","revision":{"graph_hash":"10d395f2fe493e24","run_key":"d2ddc082d9666bdd"},"priority":[],"standard":[{"action_id":"review","label":"Review","icon":"ListChecks","group":"review","press_id":"agent-next-review-decision","user_line":"Review this decision: what should I check before relying on it?","enabled":true,"why_now":"Lists what this result rests on befo